WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.274
This query counts the rows produced by the GROUP BY
approach and the window approach

00:00:06.111 --> 00:00:11.843
The grouped result has one row per patient The
window result has one

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:18.488
row per admission Neither is automatically better
They

00:00:18.514 --> 00:00:21.356
answer different analytical output-grain questions
